2026-07-26T10:39:09.5980687Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-26T10:39:09.6046268Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-26T10:39:09.6047173Z i /tmp/RtmpTxsplW/duckdb
2026-07-26T10:39:09.6047529Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-26T10:39:09.6047940Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-26T10:39:09.6048615Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-26T10:39:09.6049190Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T10:39:09.6050252Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T10:39:09.6051211Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-26T10:39:09.6294812Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:39:09.6403765Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:39:09.6824713Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:39:09.6987144Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
